            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47480384?u=dd9f3fc94af4240d1d86769959bc59448fafffbf&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">These packages have no maintainer. I use all of them on my NixOS machine, so I add myself as maintainer.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">gammastep got its maintainers from redshift. It keeps <code class=\"notranslate\">acidbong</code> only, so this change does not make me a maintainer of gammastep.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">nixpkgs-review</code> result</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Command: <code class=\"notranslate\">nixpkgs-review rev</code> (commit <code class=\"notranslate\">5d14d630862ab98b15413f2ce0497e9df761e4f5</code>)</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">x86_64-linux</code></h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">No rebuilds (meta change only). I also built all 9 packages (with gammastep).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">AI disclosure: this change and this description were prepared with Claude Code (Claude Opus 5.5). I reviewed the diff and the build results before I opened this PR.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Things done</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Fits <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md\">CONTRIBUTING.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md\">pkgs/README.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/maintainers/README.md\">maintainers/README.md</a> and other READMEs.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Follows the <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#automationai-policy\">automation/AI policy</a>.</li>\n<li>Built on platform:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=